cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MAMUT-routing-Ortec2022
type: dataset
message: >-
  Cite this metadata for the MAMUT-routing curation of the Ortec2022 VRPTW benchmark. Also cite the original benchmark, the EURO Meets NeurIPS 2022 Vehicle Routing Competition organized with ORTEC support, and respect the CC BY-NC 4.0 terms given in LICENSE. Record the exact Git commit used.
