url: "https://github.com/ANR-MAMUT/MAMUT-routing-Ortec2022"
abstract: >-
  This repository provides the MAMUT-routing curation of the static VRPTW instances from the EURO Meets NeurIPS 2022 Vehicle Routing Competition, with conversions, repairs, metadata and computed best-known solutions. The ORTEC instances and related redistributed best-known solution files retain their original CC BY-NC 4.0 license, and the source attributions are documented in README.md and LICENSE.
